<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14935" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἄρειος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,</span> also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			E.
			<u>HF</u>
			413
		</span></i> (lyr.); 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀρήϊος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>; 
			Aeol.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀρεύϊος</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			Alc.
			<u>Supp.</u>
			1a
		</span></i>.<i><span class="en">
			10
		</span></i>: (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἄρης</span>):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>devoted to Ares, warlike,
			martial</i>; in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i>, mostly of warriors, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Μενέλαος Ἀρήιος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					3.339
				</span></i>
			, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀρήϊοι υἷες Ἀχαιῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11.800
				</span></i>
			, al.; of arms, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀρήϊα τεύχεα δύω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					6.340
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				10.407
			</span></i>; the 
				Att.
			 form only in the phrase 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τεῖχος Ἄρειον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					4.407
				</span></i>
			, al.; also in <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
			</span></i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρήιοι ἀγῶνες</span> conflicts
				<i>in real war,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυμνικοί,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				9.33
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅπλον ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					4.23
				</span></i>
			; of a man, as Subst., <i>warrior,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				6.98
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀθηνᾶ Ἀρεία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>OGI</u>
					229.70
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Smyrna</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12(5).913
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Tenos</span>): 
				Comp.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρειότερος</span> (q.v.) <i><span class="en">
				Thgn.
				548
			</span></i> is prob. formed from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρείων,</span> as <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χερειότερος</span>
			from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χερείων.</span>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἄρειος</span> (also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἄρεος, Ἄρηος</span>)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ὁ</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μήν</span>), name
			of month in Thessaly, <i><span class="en">
				<u>GDI</u>
				1449
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἄρειον πεδίον,</span>
			=
			<i>Campus Martius,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				7.59
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Pomp.</u>
				53
			</span></i> (also name of a plain in Thrace, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				13.10.7
			</span></i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν τελῶν τὸ καλούμενον
				Ἄρειον,</span>
			=
			<i>legio Martia,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				App.
				<u>BC</u>
				3.45
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἄρεια, τά,</span>
			=
			<i>ludi Martiales,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				56.46
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἄρειον, τό,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξιφίον</span>
			, Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.20
			</span></i>; 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰσάτις</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				2.184
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἄριος, Μάγοι καὶ πᾶν τὸ
					Ἄρειον γένος</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				Dam.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				125
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
